Description: Creates meta-packages in the style of the 'tidyverse' to distribute
    interdependent packages as one bundle. Supports sharing an internal
    toolkit without requiring component publication in a repository or a
    successful 'R CMD check'. Includes component archives by default and uses
    dependency graphs for topological installation ordering and cycle
    detection. The generated installer adds missing components and, by
    default, upgrades only those whose bundled version is newer than the
    installed version. External dependencies can be provided in advance or
    installed from an explicitly configured repository. Generates package
    source, installation helpers, and documentation.
